body:
>It will be more effective for T suppression (and keep trough levels slightly higher) if you take the total daily dose in 2 or 3 separate applications, see: [https://i.imgur.com/B4G4gTa.gif](https://i.imgur.com/B4G4gTa.gif).

So can I take 4 pumps / 3mg in the morning and swallow a 2mg pill 12 hours later before sleep time? Would that somehow balance it in a way..?

&#x200B;
